      "source": "## What does this program print? {type=short case=sensitive tags=basics}\n\n```rust\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", 7 / 2);\n}\n```\n\n```answer\naccept: [\"3\"]\n```\n\n::: explanation\nBoth operands are integers, so `/` is integer division and truncates toward zero. Use `7.0 / 2.0` to get `3.5`.\n:::\n",
